{"seq":2,"slug":"chain-of-thought","title":"思维链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/prompt-engineering/chain-of-thought","wordCount":831,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"思维链\">思维链</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>CoT 家族的方法共享同一个思想内核，差别在于「如何组织推理」，核心概念如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>思维链（CoT）</strong>：让模型在给出最终答案前先展示中间推理步骤，把一次性映射拆成可展开的序列。</li>\n<li><strong>Few-shot CoT</strong>：示例中不仅给「输入 → 输出」，还给出完整推理过程，模型据此模仿推理格式。</li>\n<li><strong>Zero-shot CoT</strong>：不给示例，只用「让我们一步步思考」这类触发短语激活推理，成本最低。</li>\n<li><strong>思维树（ToT）</strong>：把线性推理扩展为树状搜索，生成多条思路、逐一评估后深入最有前景的分支。</li>\n<li><strong>自一致性（Self-Consistency）</strong>：高温度多次采样不同推理路径，再对最终答案多数投票。</li>\n<li><strong>采样次数与成本</strong>：Zero-shot/Few-shot CoT 是 1x 成本，Self-Consistency 与 ToT 是 Nx 成本。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>方法选择的实质是<strong>在「成本」与「可靠性」之间做取舍</strong>：Zero-shot CoT 以一句话的成本拿到大部分增益，而 Self-Consistency、ToT 用多倍算力换取更高可靠性，只值得用在关键决策场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"什么是思维链\">什么是思维链</h2><p>思维链（Chain of Thought, CoT）是一种让 LLM 在给出最终答案前，先展示中间推理步骤的提示技术。它显著提升了模型在数学、逻辑和多步推理任务上的表现。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 无 CoT&#10;        Q1[&quot;问题&quot;] --&gt; A1[&quot;直接回答&lt;br/&gt;(常错误)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 有 CoT&#10;        Q2[&quot;问题&quot;] --&gt; S1[&quot;步骤 1&quot;]&#10;        S1 --&gt; S2[&quot;步骤 2&quot;]&#10;        S2 --&gt; S3[&quot;步骤 3&quot;]&#10;        S3 --&gt; A2[&quot;最终答案&lt;br/&gt;(更准确)&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 无 CoT\n        Q1[\"问题\"] --&gt; A1[\"直接回答&lt;br/&gt;(常错误)\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 有 CoT\n        Q2[\"问题\"] --&gt; S1[\"步骤 1\"]\n        S1 --&gt; S2[\"步骤 2\"]\n        S2 --&gt; S3[\"步骤 3\"]\n        S3 --&gt; A2[\"最终答案&lt;br/&gt;(更准确)\"]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"标准-cot\">标准 CoT</h2><p>标准 CoT 通过在 few-shot 示例中包含推理过程来引导模型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"standard_cot_prompt = &quot;&quot;&quot;解答以下数学问题，请展示你的思考步骤。&#10;&#10;问题：小明有 15 个苹果，他给了小红 3 个，又买了 7 个。小明现在有多少个苹果？&#10;&#10;思考过程：&#10;1. 小明初始有 15 个苹果&#10;2. 给了小红 3 个: 15 - 3 = 12 个&#10;3. 又买了 7 个: 12 + 7 = 19 个&#10;&#10;答案：19 个苹果&#10;&#10;问题：一个班有 40 名学生，其中 60% 选了数学课，选数学课的学生中有 75% 同时选了物理课。同时选了数学和物理的学生有多少人？&#10;&#10;思考过程：&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;&#10;print(standard_cot_prompt)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">standard_cot_prompt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"\"\"解答以下数学问题，请展示你的思考步骤。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">问题：小明有 15 个苹果，他给了小红 3 个，又买了 7 个。小明现在有多少个苹果？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">思考过程：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1. 小明初始有 15 个苹果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">2. 给了小红 3 个: 15 - 3 = 12 个</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">3. 又买了 7 个: 12 + 7 = 19 个</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">答案：19 个苹果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">问题：一个班有 40 名学生，其中 60% 选了数学课，选数学课的学生中有 75% 同时选了物理课。同时选了数学和物理的学生有多少人？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">思考过程：\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(standard_cot_prompt)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>示例需求</th>\n<th>推理展示</th>\n<th>准确率提升</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>直接回答</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Few-shot</td>\n<td>2-5 个</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>小幅提升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Few-shot CoT</td>\n<td>2-5 个（含推理）</td>\n<td>完整步骤</td>\n<td>大幅提升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Zero-shot CoT</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>触发短语</td>\n<td>显著提升</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"zero-shot-cot\">Zero-shot CoT</h2><p>Zero-shot CoT 不需要提供示例，只需在提示末尾添加魔法短语&quot;让我们一步步思考&quot;（Let&#39;s think step by step）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"zero_shot_cot_prompts = {&#10;    &quot;中文触发&quot;: &quot;请一步一步地思考这个问题。&quot;,&#10;    &quot;英文触发&quot;: &quot;Let&#39;s think step by step.&quot;,&#10;    &quot;结构化触发&quot;: &quot;请按以下方式分析：1) 识别关键信息 2) 列出推理步骤 3) 得出结论&quot;,&#10;}&#10;&#10;def apply_zero_shot_cot(question, trigger=&quot;请一步一步地思考这个问题。&quot;):&#10;    return f&quot;{question}\\n\\n{trigger}&quot;&#10;&#10;question = &quot;如果训练一个 7B 模型需要 8 张 A100 GPU 跑 3 天，那么训练一个 70B 模型大约需要多少 GPU 天？&quot;&#10;prompt = apply_zero_shot_cot(question)&#10;print(prompt)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">zero_shot_cot_prompts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"中文触发\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"请一步一步地思考这个问题。\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"英文触发\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Let's think step by step.\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"结构化触发\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"请按以下方式分析：1) 识别关键信息 2) 列出推理步骤 3) 得出结论\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> apply_zero_shot_cot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(question, trigger</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"请一步一步地思考这个问题。\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">question</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}\\n\\n{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">trigger</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">question </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"如果训练一个 7B 模型需要 8 张 A100 GPU 跑 3 天，那么训练一个 70B 模型大约需要多少 GPU 天？\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prompt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> apply_zero_shot_cot(question)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(prompt)</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    Q[&quot;复杂问题&quot;] --&gt; ZC[&quot;添加: 请一步一步思考&quot;]&#10;    ZC --&gt; LLM[&quot;LLM&quot;]&#10;    LLM --&gt; R1[&quot;步骤 1: 分析已知条件&quot;]&#10;    R1 --&gt; R2[&quot;步骤 2: 建立关系&quot;]&#10;    R2 --&gt; R3[&quot;步骤 3: 逐步计算&quot;]&#10;    R3 --&gt; A[&quot;最终答案&quot;]\">flowchart TB\n    Q[\"复杂问题\"] --&gt; ZC[\"添加: 请一步一步思考\"]\n    ZC --&gt; LLM[\"LLM\"]\n    LLM --&gt; R1[\"步骤 1: 分析已知条件\"]\n    R1 --&gt; R2[\"步骤 2: 建立关系\"]\n    R2 --&gt; R3[\"步骤 3: 逐步计算\"]\n    R3 --&gt; A[\"最终答案\"]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Zero-shot CoT 的效果在大模型（&gt;10B 参数）上最为显著。在小模型上，推理步骤可能不连贯反而降低准确率。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"思维树\">思维树</h2><p>思维树（Tree of Thought, ToT）扩展了 CoT 的线性推理为树状搜索，模型可以探索多条推理路径并评估每条路径的前景：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    Q[&quot;问题&quot;] --&gt; T1[&quot;思路 A&quot;]&#10;    Q --&gt; T2[&quot;思路 B&quot;]&#10;    Q --&gt; T3[&quot;思路 C&quot;]&#10;    T1 --&gt; E1[&quot;评估: 有前景&quot;]&#10;    T2 --&gt; E2[&quot;评估: 无前景&quot;]&#10;    T3 --&gt; E3[&quot;评估: 有前景&quot;]&#10;    E1 --&gt; T1a[&quot;A 继续深入&quot;]&#10;    E3 --&gt; T3a[&quot;C 继续深入&quot;]&#10;    T1a --&gt; A1[&quot;答案候选 1&quot;]&#10;    T3a --&gt; A2[&quot;答案候选 2&quot;]&#10;    A1 --&gt; Best[&quot;选择最佳答案&quot;]&#10;    A2 --&gt; Best\">flowchart TB\n    Q[\"问题\"] --&gt; T1[\"思路 A\"]\n    Q --&gt; T2[\"思路 B\"]\n    Q --&gt; T3[\"思路 C\"]\n    T1 --&gt; E1[\"评估: 有前景\"]\n    T2 --&gt; E2[\"评估: 无前景\"]\n    T3 --&gt; E3[\"评估: 有前景\"]\n    E1 --&gt; T1a[\"A 继续深入\"]\n    E3 --&gt; T3a[\"C 继续深入\"]\n    T1a --&gt; A1[\"答案候选 1\"]\n    T3a --&gt; A2[\"答案候选 2\"]\n    A1 --&gt; Best[\"选择最佳答案\"]\n    A2 --&gt; Best</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def tree_of_thought_prompt(question, num_paths=3):&#10;    return f&quot;&quot;&quot;问题：{question}&#10;&#10;请用以下思维树方法解决：&#10;&#10;第一步：生成 {num_paths} 种不同的解题思路&#10;思路 1:&#10;思路 2:&#10;思路 3:&#10;&#10;第二步：评估每种思路&#10;- 思路 1 评估: [有前景/无前景] 理由:&#10;- 思路 2 评估: [有前景/无前景] 理由:&#10;- 思路 3 评估: [有前景/无前景] 理由:&#10;&#10;第三步：深入最有前景的思路，完成推理&#10;&#10;第四步：给出最终答案&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;&#10;prompt = tree_of_thought_prompt(&quot;如何设计一个支持百万级文档的 RAG 系统？&quot;)&#10;print(prompt)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tree_of_thought_prompt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(question, num_paths</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"\"问题：</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">question</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">请用以下思维树方法解决：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">第一步：生成 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">num_paths</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 种不同的解题思路</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">思路 1:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">思路 2:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">思路 3:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">第二步：评估每种思路</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">- 思路 1 评估: [有前景/无前景] 理由:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">- 思路 2 评估: [有前景/无前景] 理由:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">- 思路 3 评估: [有前景/无前景] 理由:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">第三步：深入最有前景的思路，完成推理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">第四步：给出最终答案\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prompt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tree_of_thought_prompt(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"如何设计一个支持百万级文档的 RAG 系统？\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(prompt)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"自一致性\">自一致性</h2><p>自一致性（Self-Consistency）通过多次采样不同的推理路径，然后对最终答案进行多数投票来提高准确率：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import random&#10;from collections import Counter&#10;&#10;def self_consistency(question, llm, num_samples=5, temperature=0.7):&#10;    answers = []&#10;    for i in range(num_samples):&#10;        prompt = f&quot;{question}\\n\\n请一步一步地思考这个问题。&quot;&#10;        response = llm.generate(prompt, temperature=temperature)&#10;        answer = extract_answer(response)&#10;        answers.append(answer)&#10;&#10;    vote = Counter(answers)&#10;    best_answer = vote.most_common(1)[0]&#10;    confidence = best_answer[1] / num_samples&#10;&#10;    return best_answer[0], confidence&#10;&#10;def extract_answer(response):&#10;    return response.strip().split(&quot;\\n&quot;)[-1]&#10;&#10;simulated_answers = [&quot;42&quot;, &quot;42&quot;, &quot;40&quot;, &quot;42&quot;, &quot;41&quot;]&#10;vote = Counter(simulated_answers)&#10;best = vote.most_common(1)[0]&#10;print(f&quot;采样答案: {simulated_answers}&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;最终答案: {best[0]} (一致率: {best[1]/len(simulated_answers)*100:.0f}%)&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> random</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> collections </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Counter</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> self_consistency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(question, llm, num_samples</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, temperature</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    answers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(num_samples):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        prompt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">question</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}\\n\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">请一步一步地思考这个问题。\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        response </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> llm.generate(prompt, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">temperature</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">temperature)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        answer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> extract_answer(response)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        answers.append(answer)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    vote </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Counter(answers)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    best_answer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vote.most_common(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    confidence </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> best_answer[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num_samples</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> best_answer[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], confidence</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> extract_answer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(response):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response.strip().split(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">simulated_answers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"42\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"42\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"40\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"42\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"41\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">vote </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Counter(simulated_answers)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">best </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vote.most_common(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"采样答案: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">simulated_answers</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"最终答案: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">best[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> (一致率: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">best[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(simulated_answers)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.0f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">%)\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    Q[&quot;问题 + CoT&quot;] --&gt; S1[&quot;采样 1: 路径 A → 答案 42&quot;]&#10;    Q --&gt; S2[&quot;采样 2: 路径 B → 答案 42&quot;]&#10;    Q --&gt; S3[&quot;采样 3: 路径 C → 答案 40&quot;]&#10;    Q --&gt; S4[&quot;采样 4: 路径 D → 答案 42&quot;]&#10;    Q --&gt; S5[&quot;采样 5: 路径 E → 答案 41&quot;]&#10;    S1 &amp; S2 &amp; S3 &amp; S4 &amp; S5 --&gt; Vote[&quot;多数投票&quot;]&#10;    Vote --&gt; Final[&quot;最终答案: 42 (60%)&quot;]\">flowchart TB\n    Q[\"问题 + CoT\"] --&gt; S1[\"采样 1: 路径 A → 答案 42\"]\n    Q --&gt; S2[\"采样 2: 路径 B → 答案 42\"]\n    Q --&gt; S3[\"采样 3: 路径 C → 答案 40\"]\n    Q --&gt; S4[\"采样 4: 路径 D → 答案 42\"]\n    Q --&gt; S5[\"采样 5: 路径 E → 答案 41\"]\n    S1 &amp; S2 &amp; S3 &amp; S4 &amp; S5 --&gt; Vote[\"多数投票\"]\n    Vote --&gt; Final[\"最终答案: 42 (60%)\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"cot-方法对比\">CoT 方法对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Zero-shot CoT</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>1x</td>\n<td>简单推理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Few-shot CoT</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>1x</td>\n<td>结构化推理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Self-Consistency</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>Nx</td>\n<td>需要高可靠性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tree of Thought</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>Nx</td>\n<td>复杂搜索问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ReAct</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>Nx</td>\n<td>需要工具调用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在实际应用中，Zero-shot CoT 的&quot;性价比&quot;最高——只需添加一句话就能显著提升推理能力。对于关键决策场景，Self-Consistency 以适度的成本换取更高的可靠性。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CoT 通过展示中间推理步骤显著提升 LLM 在复杂推理任务上的表现。</li>\n<li>Zero-shot CoT 只需添加&quot;让我们一步步思考&quot;即可触发推理能力。</li>\n<li>思维树（ToT）将线性推理扩展为树状搜索，适合复杂决策问题。</li>\n<li>自一致性通过多次采样和投票提高答案可靠性。</li>\n<li>CoT 方法的效果与模型规模正相关，在大模型上效果最显著。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"思维链","id":"思维链"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"什么是思维链","id":"什么是思维链"},{"level":2,"text":"标准 CoT","id":"标准-cot"},{"level":2,"text":"Zero-shot CoT","id":"zero-shot-cot"},{"level":2,"text":"思维树","id":"思维树"},{"level":2,"text":"自一致性","id":"自一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"CoT 方法对比","id":"cot-方法对比"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"提示词设计模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/prompt-engineering/prompt-design-patterns"},"next":{"title":"少样本学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/prompt-engineering/few-shot-learning"}}